  "description": "Han Segeun was a restless kid with a life and family too ordinary to satisfy him. He chased speed and trouble, wishing he could break free from the dull days ahead. Then, a vampire granted that wish by slaughtering everyone he loved. Saved by Sylvester, the excommunicated Vampire Lord Hunter, Segeun enters the world of the mad moon, a hidden war where vampires prey on humans and hunters kill for cash. Can Segeun live long enough for revenge, or will the night take him like it took his family?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
